    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/103c55d02c549f165c1e72a6e8d2d075.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=540 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/103c55d02c549f165c1e72a6e8d2d075.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/103c55d02c549f165c1e72a6e8d2d075.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>&quot; Contrary to most expectations,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>and even our most distant fictions,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>we have solved the biggest basic problems of our civilization, and many others,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>and now we are living the beginning of a new and very different era,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>of much less pain and much more harmony for the human world.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>But they arrived... &quot;</i></strong><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crack Spaceships:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several enemy spaceship types, each with different weapons and aproachs to destroy you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a Boss Keeper of each &quot;World&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve your Tank</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your tank for your gameplay style,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with various specialties and their levels of upgrade:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- (6) Six Different Main Weapons;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- (3) Three Types of Super Weapons;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- (4) Four Main tank estructures ;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- (4) Four &quot;Defense&quot; gadget types;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Colors and Paintings;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f06b5465407a4e405f50ec35b126d2a5.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=240 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f06b5465407a4e405f50ec35b126d2a5.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f06b5465407a4e405f50ec35b126d2a5.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>______<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/20d06cb2af892775575cb7ac210f100e.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=240 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/20d06cb2af892775575cb7ac210f100e.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/20d06cb2af892775575cb7ac210f100e.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and walk around fantasy and also known &quot;Worlds&quot; of the Solar System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 worlds each with 3 different different moments, and several stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose, and get more Lead Pilots to the Resistence:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release more lead pilots to drive your tank when reaching different worlds(depending on the chosen difficulty level), through the defense campaign against the invading aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Lead Pilot with their own characteristics .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/cc5abc08e1571c235d83c078b12e75fe.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=240 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/cc5abc08e1571c235d83c078b12e75fe.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/cc5abc08e1571c235d83c078b12e75fe.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>______<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f3e83eea6a371258dedd8ae7657c27e0.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=240 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f3e83eea6a371258dedd8ae7657c27e0.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/f3e83eea6a371258dedd8ae7657c27e0.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(3) Three Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8-Bit times <i>/ game mode based in lives like in the old video games </i> ;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rogue Survive <i>/ gaining levels of moral points you can choose upgrades and resources cards to your tank, checkpoints just between worlds</i> ;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Persistent gain <i>/ where everything you advance is saved for when you play again</i> ;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(3) Three Game Difficulty levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(2) Two bonus stage types.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain combo system to Score.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release New different Visual render Styles for gameplay at the end of each game mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/ef64e00105215cc180fd0a04c2965eba.poster.avif?t=1754068157\" width=540 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/ef64e00105215cc180fd0a04c2965eba.webm?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988100/extras/ef64e00105215cc180fd0a04c2965eba.mp4?t=1754068157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
